      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FARMOR AGAIN (4) boasts a strong record this journey here with five wins and three minors from 12 tries. Comes off a (21.63) win last time, scoring by half a length in a Grade 4 over 380m at this track. Rates a leading player. FARMOR JACUZZIS (8) is a well performed sprinter ideally suited at the shorter trips. Was seventh last time (22.16) over 380m at this track in a Free For All. Solid record here at the distance winning eight races. Has ability and can measure up. FARMOR BACARDI (7) ran below her best last time finishing fifth (23.96) over 407m at Rockhampton in a Grade 1/2. Has a good record here including eight wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from five attempts. Likely to be thereabouts. MAPLE WAVE (1) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
